{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c0298205-4f2b-8aca-9e0e-fa3b98840f50",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:33:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I need a, um, a new bin. For recycling. Mine is broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A replacement recycling bin, okay. Can you tell me what happened to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The wind take it. After the storm. It go in the street and a car, [pause] a car drive on it. It is cracked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that nor'easter that ended Saturday, I bet. Lots of bins blew around. Okay, so it's cracked and not usable anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Not usable. One moment please. I fix my mirror. It is crooked. I am in the car, I fix it while I talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'm right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry. Now is good. The mirror is straight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can I get the address where the bin is picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty-seven Marsh Street. In the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty-seven Marsh Street, in the Point. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carmela Cardillo. C-A-R-M-E-L-A. Cardillo, C-A-R-D-I-L-L-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Carmela. I have Carmela Cardillo, eighty-seven Marsh Street, replacement recycling bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Is there a fee? For the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a bin that's been damaged, I'd say it's usually handled without much fuss, but I'm not sure on the fee side. I'll put a note on the request and have someone confirm with you when they call about delivery. Is this a good number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. This phone. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two. Perfect. Someone will call you back about the fee and when the bin comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Carmela. Drive safe."
    }
  ],
